; The one variable: a label line wider than its paragraph box. Button draws through
; TextParagraph::draw, which skips glyphs left of clip_l and stops at the first glyph past clip_r
; (text_paragraph.cpp:925-931). The three clip_text Buttons share one 60 px box and differ only in
; alignment; the last wraps "supercalifragilistic go" at autowrap_mode = 2 around a word wider than
; its box. A label that fits never cuts, so unit-button and unit-button-autowrap show no change.

